# Requests with the transport directives, for the parser's fuzzing and
# for trying the transport by hand: host is an echo server, slow one
# that answers late.

### Lower limits than the flags give
# @name limits
# @timeout 2 s
# @connection-timeout 500 ms
# @max-time 5
GET {{host}}/limits

### A limit above the flag's: a warning, and the flag's holds
# @name above
# @max-time 10 m
GET {{host}}/above

### The server answers after the read timeout
# @name slow
# @timeout 1
GET {{slow}}/

### Directives of other clients: a warning, and the request runs
# @name foreign
# @note are you sure?
# @sleep 100
GET {{host}}/foreign HTTP/2 (Prior Knowledge)
